# Mosquitto ACL file. Format per `mosquitto.conf(5)`.
# Three identities; least privilege per role.
# Live publisher: github.com/Promithius-DR/comfortnet · Historical design: docs/archive/COMFORTNET_PIPELINE.md

# comfortnet-publisher: writes telemetry from the Pi 3B sniffer.
# May publish to its topic tree, no read access.
user comfortnet-publisher
topic write home/utility-room/hvac/comfortnet/#

# telegraf: subscribes for InfluxDB writes (continuous + events).
# Read-only.
user telegraf
topic read home/utility-room/hvac/comfortnet/#

# n8n: subscribes for event-driven automation (faults, stage changes).
# Read-only, scoped to events subtree.
user n8n
topic read home/utility-room/hvac/comfortnet/events/#
